title: Economic Expansion
subtitle: The economy is growing steadily.
new-page: true
view-if: economic_expansion >= 85 and disfavored <= 6 and inflation <= 6 and marcher_in_government
on-arrival: economic_expansion = 0; capital_strike_progress -= 2 if capital_strike_progress >= 2; budget += 1; pro_republic += 5; commons_marcher += 3*(1-dissent) if marcher_in_government; burgher_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if marcher_in_government; guild_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if marcher_in_government; landed_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if marcher_in_government; burgher_ddp += 5 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or (in_popular_front and not liberal_parliament); commons_collectivist += 3 if in_popular_front or in_left_front; guild_gold += 4 if in_grand_coalition; burgher_gold += 3 if in_grand_coalition; guild_lvp += 8 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition; burgher_lvp += 8 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition; ddp_left += 1; ddp_left += 1 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition; gold_left += 1; gold_left += 2 if in_grand_coalition; lvp_left += 1; lvp_left += 2 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition; inflation += 0.4; economy_goal_marcher += 1; economy_goal_marcher_peoples += 1
tags: event

= Economic Expansion

The Commonwealth economy has been growing steadily for an extended period of time, and has low inflation and unemployment. The government is rewarded by additional tax revenue from the same tax rates. Even the guild-masters find that they have little to complain about when it comes to government policies. One downside of this economic growth, however, is the rising risk of inflation.